{"id":4102,"date":"2024-01-31T09:24:19","date_gmt":"2024-01-31T09:24:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4102"},"modified":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","modified_gmt":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","slug":"proof-of-the-pudding-jack-trench-is-to-be-installed-at-london-fields-primary-school-for-a-seminal-food-co-design","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/proof-of-the-pudding-jack-trench-is-to-be-installed-at-london-fields-primary-school-for-a-seminal-food-co-design\/","title":{"rendered":"Proof of the pudding: Jack Trench is to be installed at London Fields Primary School for a seminal food co-design"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1433\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4103 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1433;width:1071px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-300x168.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-1024x573.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-768x430.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-1536x860.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-2048x1146.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-357x200.jpg 357w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Pao_Food-Pic_3-200x112.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>A pickled egg. Image courtesy of Pao Liu<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How will you boil an egg in the year 2050? A glib question maybe, but a radically altered climate will affect the way we carry out even the most basic day-to-day tasks.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Imagine a world which is extremely hot, extremely cold, or flooded. How will we source, prepare, cook, and eat our food? Under what protective conditions will we do it? We will be forced to do things differently. Are there opportunities to do things better?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are all questions that designer <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jacktrench.co.uk\/\">Jack Trench<\/a> and a team of experts will be exploring with our fledgling Year 5 designers at London Fields Primary School in Hackney under the banner Future Food Space. The teachers are already introducing the children to the subject for his arrival in February.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1650\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4111 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1650;width:1085px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-1024x660.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-768x495.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-1536x990.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-2048x1320.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-310x200.jpg 310w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Jack_Julie_PORTRAIT-edit-2-194x125.jpg 194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Jack Trench and Julie Chan<\/em> <\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Over the course of six weeks, our co-design collaboration will teach children about how future-focused design can put food on our plates. Biophilic techniques (using nature in design with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.oliverheath.com\/\">Oliver Heath<\/a>); sustainable material use; and even a food preservation workshop with fermentation experts <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/paopopnpickles\/\">Pao Liu<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jelena.belgrave\/\">Jelena Belgrave<\/a>, will keep our children busy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The grand reveal of London Fields Primary School\u2019s food-based designs and settings in June, with creative collaboration and support of locally based co-design partners \u2018<a href=\"https:\/\/www.acrylicize.com\/perspectives\/welcome-to-the-art-house-by-acrylicize\">The Art House<\/a>\u2019 at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.acrylicize.com\/\">Acrylicize<\/a>, will no doubt be a mouth-watering experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1084\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4108 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1084;width:131px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-300x127.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1024x434.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-768x325.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1536x651.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-2048x867.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-360x152.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-200x85.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>How will we boil an egg in the year 2050? Jack Trench and a team of experts will be looking at the future of food in our latest co-design<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":4103,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[12],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4102","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ccac-news"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Proof of the pudding: Jack Trench is to be installed at London Fields Primary School for a seminal food co-design - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/proof-of-the-pudding-jack-trench-is-to-be-installed-at-london-fields-primary-school-for-a-seminal-food-co-design\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"P